{"id":2760,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>12月15日，我院韩秀兰老师在15104Z教室为全体研三同学开展“论文写作规范提升——目录逻辑结构规范”专题讲座，系统讲解学位论文中目录的逻辑结构规范问题。</p><p>韩老师基于中北大学研究生学位论文撰写规范与历年评审要点，从目录的核心功能出发，重点阐述“章节间逻辑框架的构建”“层级标题的命名规范”以及“目录与正文内容的一致性”三大关键议题；针对普遍存在的目录层级混乱、标题与内容脱节等问题，韩老师借助典型论文案例，具体演示目录的优化路径与操作方法；此外，对于同学们提出的个性化问题，韩老师也分别给予解答，协助其梳理思路，明确修改方向。</p><p>本次讲座聚焦研三同学论文写作的关键痛点，有效解决同学们在论文逻辑结构方面存在的困惑，为其顺利完成学位论文奠定基础。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gL8VL7nRVVnz78MMzTkoRrfMzvbLNCoPUzMkLllsU8CiMmv0gihFp2hmCIa0nkh7MkhfokyZUzQkUmWkU8lsnzrRU87YUmC4ozf2nmN8LlMFLlQ2LRTfL4WFo7Mknkb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CYLRlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6205&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DD4A88A6BB2BCE7E5CCA2B6390FF941C/1FF09A32/8CBD\" vheight=\"187.1300048828125\" vwidth=\"324.20001220703125\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gL8VL7nRVVnz78MMzTkoRrfMzvbLNCoPUzMkLllsU8CiMmv0gihFp2hmCIa0nkh7MkhfokyZUzQkUmWkU8lsnzrRU87YUmC4ozf2nmN8LlMFLlQ2LRTfL4WFo7Mknkb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CYLRlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6205&e=.jpeg\"></p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gL8VL7nRVVnz78MMzTkoRrfMzvbLNCoPUzMkLllsU8CiMmv0gihFp2hmCIa0nkh7MkhfokyZUzQkUmWkU8lsnzrRU87YUmC4ozf2nmN8LlMFLlQ2LRTfL4WFo7Mknkb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CYLRlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6205&e=.jpeg"}